@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title Car Repair Platform — Use Case Diagram
actor "Visitor" as Visitor
actor "Customer" as Customer
actor "Specialist" as Specialist
actor "Administrator" as Administrator
rectangle "Car Repair Platform website" {
  usecase "Search specialists and view profiles\n(UC01, FR-02–04)" as UC01
  usecase "Read published reviews\n(UC02, FR-13)" as UC02
  usecase "Register or sign in\n(UC03, FR-01)" as UC03
  usecase "Submit and track own requests\n(UC04, FR-05–06)" as UC04
  usecase "Confirm or dispute completion\n(UC05, FR-08)" as UC05
  usecase "Leave a verified review\n(UC06, FR-09)" as UC06
  usecase "Submit and track complaints\n(UC07, FR-11)" as UC07
  usecase "Manage own profile and services\n(UC08, FR-02)" as UC08
  usecase "Accept or decline requests\n(UC09, FR-07)" as UC09
  usecase "Update work status\n(UC10, FR-07)" as UC10
  usecase "Review and resolve complaints\n(UC11, FR-12)" as UC11
  usecase "Moderate published reviews\n(UC12, FR-12–13)" as UC12
}
Visitor -- UC01
Visitor -- UC02
Visitor -- UC03
Customer -- UC04
Customer -- UC05
Customer -- UC06
Customer -- UC07
Specialist -- UC08
Specialist -- UC09
Specialist -- UC10
Administrator -- UC11
Administrator -- UC12
Specialist -- UC07
note bottom of UC06
Only the request owner can review after
customer-confirmed completion; one review per request.
end note
@enduml
